data.value:
Only the current user (HKCU) scope is written, so administrator rights aren't needed. The current default app for each extension isn't changed.
After registering, choose ohmyZip in the Windows default apps settings that open to make it the default.
To undo: Unregister on this page (or ohmyZip.exe --unregister-file-types).

